      "repair_reason": "- [P2] No repair lane is needed; the remaining action is ordinary maintainer review of a clean, proof-backed PR with exact-head dependency approval.; Cleared: Cleared: the added parser dependency is pinned to mdast-util-from-markdown 2.0.3, already present in the lockfile with registry integrity, and exact-head dependency approval is recorded. (sha=c2ae3d25e88ddb505f044aa3ebcaa9296603fb55)",
      "review_summary": "The PR changes Memory Wiki wikilink extraction to mask mdast code and inlineCode ranges before link scanning, adds focused markdown and lint regressions, exports extractWikiLinks for tests, and declares mdast-util-from-markdown as a plugin dependency.\n\nPR surface: Source +29, Tests +129, Config +1, Other +3. Total +162 across 5 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current main masks only simple backtick fences and single-line inline code, while the PR tests cover tilde fences, container fences, invalid fence-looking lines, and multiline code spans that current main does not handle. I did not run a live CLI repro in this read-only review.",
